i+\\left(- \\frac{21}{128}\\right)\\,\\mathbf j+\\left(- \\frac{39}{128}\\right)\\,\\mathbf k" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186551576} {:answer/id #uuid "d8f42c0b-0803-5b4d-8016-ffcfa69893e6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\left(- \\frac{9}{16}\\right)\\,\\mathbf i+\\left(- \\frac{3}{8}\\right)\\,\\mathbf j+\\left(- \\frac{3}{8}\\right)\\,\\mathbf k" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186551588} {:answer/id #uuid "e3b6ffbe-06e6-5a8e-aa0d-15175a4f5276" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "(-108)\\,\\mathbf i+(-42)\\,\\mathbf j+(-78)\\,\\mathbf k" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186551590} {:answer/id #uuid "e84af700-5850-5c73-acbb-9a21f7272a45" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{9}{64}\\right)\\,\\mathbf i+\\left(\\frac{27}{128}\\right)\\,\\mathbf j+\\left(\\frac{9}{128}\\right)\\,\\mathbf k" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186551594}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186551576} :answer-field/id #uuid "14b7b09b-52da-5d72-b8df-bfa64684203c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186551538}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "74938ef6-c9c2-59ba-827d-91ac5ff5232a" :question/problem "Evaluate $∇g(x,y,z)$ at the point $(-2,-3,-3)$ if $g(x,y,z)=\\frac{x y z}{2 x + 3 y + z}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}_{x}(x,y,z) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}\\left(\\frac{x y z}{2 x + 3 y + z}\\right) \\\\  & =\\frac{(2 x + 3 y + z)(y z)-(x y z)(2)}{(2 x + 3 y + z)^2} \\\\  & =\\frac{y z \\left(3 y + z\\right)}{\\left(2 x + 3 y + z\\right)^{2}} \\\\ {g}_{y}(x,y,z) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}\\left(\\frac{x y z}{2 x + 3 y + z}\\right) \\\\  & =\\frac{(2 x + 3 y + z)(x z)-(x y z)(3)}{(2 x + 3 y + z)^2} \\\\  & =\\frac{x z \\left(2 x + z\\right)}{\\left(2 x + 3 y + z\\right)^{2}} \\\\ {g}_{z}(x,y,z) & =\\frac{∂}{∂z}\\left(\\frac{x y z}{2 x + 3 y + z}\\right) \\\\  & =\\frac{(2 x + 3 y + z)(x y)-(x y z)(1)}{(2 x + 3 y + z)^2} \\\\  & =\\frac{x y \\left(2 x + 3 y\\right)}{\\left(2 x + 3 y + z\\right)^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the gradient is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇g(x,y,z) & ={g}_{x}(x,y,z)\\,\\mathbf i+{g}_{y}(x,y,z)\\,\\mathbf j+{g}_{z}(x,y,z)\\,\\mathbf k \\\\  & =(- \\frac{2 x y z}{\\left(2 x + 3 y + z\\right)^{2}} + \\frac{y z}{2 x + 3 y + z})\\,\\mathbf i+(- \\frac{3 x y z}{\\left(2 x + 3 y + z\\right)^{2}} + \\frac{x z}{2 x + 3 y + z})\\,\\mathbf j+(- \\frac{x y z}{\\left(2 x + 3 y + z\\right)^{2}} + \\frac{x y}{2 x + 3 y + z})\\,\\mathbf k \\\\ ∇g(-2,-3,-3) & =\\left(\\frac{(-16)(9)-(-18)(2)}{(-16)^2}\\right)\\,\\mathbf i+\\left(\\frac{(-16)(6)-(-18)(3)}{(-16)^2}\\right)\\,\\mathbf j+\\left(\\frac{(-16)(6)-(-18)(1)}{(-16)^2}\\right)\\,\\mathbf k \\\\  & =\\left(- \\frac{27}{64}\\right)\\,\\mathbf i+\\left(- \\frac{21}{128}\\right)\\,\\mathbf j+\\left(- \\frac{39}{128}\\right)\\,\\mathbf k \\\\  & =\\left(- \\frac{27}{64}\\right)\\,\\mathbf i+\\left(- \\frac{21}{128}\\right)\\,\\mathbf j+\\left(- \\frac{39}{128}\\right)\\,\\mathbf k\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186551568 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "81d55087-53de-5def-b995-b769126d00f5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\left(- \\frac{1}{6}\\right)\\,\\mathbf i+\\left(\\frac{5}{6}\\right)\\,\\mathbf j+\\left(\\frac{5}{6}\\right)\\,\\mathbf k" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186551563} {:answer/id #uuid "8d95b908-a2f2-59f4-aaca-fa9ce8ef8b04" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "(-6)\\,\\mathbf i+(30)\\,\\mathbf j+(30)\\,\\mathbf k" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186551569} {:answer/id #uuid "d5d497b4-435f-5624-a8cc-86c18fe21fbe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\,\\mathbf i+\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)\\,\\mathbf j+\\left(- \\frac{1}{6}\\right)\\,\\mathbf k" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186551587} {:answer/id #uuid "df4d1565-00b7-563a-8e03-f75c2a4a977d